  "title": "MasTec Announces Pricing of $650,000,000 of Senior Notes",
  "summary": "CORAL GABLES, Fla. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Aug. 6, 2026-- MasTec, Inc. (NYSE: MTZ) (“MasTec”) today announced the pricing of its public offering of $650,000,000 aggregate principal amount of senior notes due 2036. The notes will pay interest semi-annually at a rate of 5.850% and will mature on September",
